# Local build noise
build-server*.log
build-world.log

# Third-party research material (papers, saved web pages, photographs, source texts and data) stays on the machine
# of whoever collects it and is never committed; only our own notes (research/**/*.md) are tracked. Where each source
# comes from is told in the notes and fetched by tools/fetch_*.py.
research/**
!research/
!research/**/
!research/**/*.md


# Third-party source archives (the Burney Relief scan by danielpett, Sketchfab, CC BY 4.0): fetched by hand, not committed. The model
# derived from it (media/models/architecture/burney_relief.glb) and its credit stay.
models-src/*.zip

# Too large for GitHub (limit 100 MB a file) or only a tool's own backup: kept on the machine, not in git.
# gilgamesh_rodin_raw.glb is the raw Hyper3D Rodin export of Gilgameš (job ids in models-src/gilgamesh/README.md).
models-src/gilgamesh/gilgamesh_rodin_raw.glb
*.blend1

